    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/5affcc156e9f63ac07eee1348d067544.poster.avif?t=1753173076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/5affcc156e9f63ac07eee1348d067544.webm?t=1753173076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/5affcc156e9f63ac07eee1348d067544.mp4?t=1753173076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Following Mr. Squirrel and his bug buddies, you will try to reach the Edge of randomly generated forest to discover what\u2019s behind the unusual weather conditions.<br>Along the way, you will try to deliver as many nuts as possible to your hungry fellow squirrels, gaining new skills, upgrades, and ammunition in exchange. Find out what adventure lies ahead.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/4c5f8fccdf2755885f2a3bfb0f420d82.poster.avif?t=1753173076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/4c5f8fccdf2755885f2a3bfb0f420d82.webm?t=1753173076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/4c5f8fccdf2755885f2a3bfb0f420d82.mp4?t=1753173076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Challenge yourself with 5 levels of increasing difficulty, leading up to an epic beetle Boss Fight at the end of the DEMO.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/5affcc156e9f63ac07eee1348d067544.poster.avif?t=1753173076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/5affcc156e9f63ac07eee1348d067544.webm?t=1753173076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/5affcc156e9f63ac07eee1348d067544.mp4?t=1753173076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Following Mr. Squirrel and his bug buddies, you will try to reach the Edge of randomly generated forest to discover what\u2019s behind the unusual weather conditions.<br>Along the way, you will try to deliver as many nuts as possible to your hungry fellow squirrels, gaining new skills, upgrades, and ammunition in exchange. Find out what adventure lies ahead.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/4c5f8fccdf2755885f2a3bfb0f420d82.poster.avif?t=1753173076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/4c5f8fccdf2755885f2a3bfb0f420d82.webm?t=1753173076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115930/extras/4c5f8fccdf2755885f2a3bfb0f420d82.mp4?t=1753173076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Challenge yourself with 5 levels of increasing difficulty, leading up to an epic beetle Boss Fight at the end of the DEMO.",
    "short_description": "Vertical Platforming Forest Roguelite! Play as Mr. Squirrel, bouncing through lush woodlands, delivering Nutz to fellow squirrels. Tail-slap and gun down swarms of insects and critters while gaining unique skills and upgrades. Discover what's disrupting the balance of nature.",
